INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('langgenius/dify/frontend-testing', 'frontend-testing', 'langgenius', 'dify', 'official', 'frontend-testing langgenius dify official agent agentic-ai agentic-framework agentic-workflow ai automation gemini genai gpt gpt-4 llm low-code mcp nextjs no-code openai orchestration python rag workflow The frontend-testing skill generates high-quality tests for Dify frontend components, hooks, and utilities using Vitest and React Testing Library, benefiting developers and QA engineers. 该技能支持使用 Vitest 和 React Testing Library 为 Dify 前端组件、hooks 和实用程序生成高质量测试。 このスキルは、Vitest と React Testing Library を使用して Dify フロントエンドコンポーネント、hooks、ユーティリティのための高品質テストを生成することを支援します。 이 스킬은 Vitest 및 React Testing Library를 사용하여 Dify 프론트엔드 컴포넌트, hooks 및 유틸리티에 대한 고품질 테스트를 생성하는 것을 지원합니다. Genera pruebas de alta calidad para componentes, hooks y utilidades frontend con Vitest y React Testing Library Générez des tests de haute qualité pour les composants, les hooks et les utilités frontend avec Vitest et React Testing Library Erzeugen Sie hochwertige Tests für Frontend-Komponenten, -Hooks und -Utilities mit Vitest und React Testing Library O skill de teste frontend gera testes de alta qualidade para componentes, hooks e utilitários Dify usando Vitest e React Testing Library Навык фронтенд-тестирования генерирует высококачественные тесты для компонентов, хуков и утилит Dify с помощью Vitest и React Testing Library مهارة الاختبار الأمامي تنتج اختبارات عالية الجودة لمكونات و Hooks و أدوات Dify باستخدام Vitest و React Testing Library how to use frontend-testing frontend-testing setup guide Vitest and React Testing Library tutorial frontend-testing vs Jest frontend-testing install what is frontend-testing frontend-testing alternative frontend-testing best practices Vitest mock timer APIs React Testing Library integration 前端测试 Vitest React Testing Library Dify 前端组件测试 hooks 测试 实用程序测试 单元测试 集成测试 Generates tests using Vitest and React Testing Library Triggers on testing, spec files, coverage, and unit tests Supports Vitest mock/timer APIs (vi.*) Enables review of existing tests for completeness Follows established conventions and best practices from web/docs/test.md Applies to Dify frontend components, hooks, and utilities Frontend-testing is a skill that enables AI agents to generate comprehensive tests for frontend components, hooks, and utilities using established conventions and best practices.');
