estión de issues","Gestión de solicitudes de extracción","Creación, clonación y visualización de repositorios","Solicitudes de API autenticadas","Visualización de detalles de ejecuciones de flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["Gestion des problèmes","Gestion des demandes d''extraction","Création, clonage et visualisation de référentiels","Demandes d''API authentifiées","Affichage des détails des exécutions de flux de travail"],"de":["Verwaltung von Issues","Verwaltung von Pull-Requests","Erstellung, Klonen und Anzeigen von Repositorys","Authentifizierte API-Anfragen","Anzeigen von Details zu Workflow-Ausführungen"],"pt":["Gerenciar problemas e pull requests","Criar, clonar e visualizar repositórios","Fazer requisições autenticadas à API do GitHub","Visualizar detalhes sobre execuções de fluxo de trabalho"],"ru":["Управление проблемами и запросами на включение","Создание, клонирование и просмотр репозиториев","Делать аутентифицированные запросы к API GitHub","Просмотр деталей о выполнении рабочих процессов"],"ar":["إدارة المشاكل وطلبات الدمج","إنشاء ونسخ واستعراض المستودعات","إرسال طلبات مصادقة إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيت هاب","عرض تفاصيل حول تشغيل سير العمل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub CLI","命令行工具","仓库管理","问题管理","拉取请求管理","API 请求","工作流运行"],"ja":["GitHub CLI","コマンドラインツール","リポジトリ管理","問題管理","プルリクエスト管理","API リクエスト","ワークフロー実行"],"ko":["GitHub CLI","명령줄 도구","저장소 관리","문제 관리","풀 요청 관리","API 요청","워크플ロー 실행"],"es":["GitHub CLI","herramienta de línea de comandos","desarrollo de software","gestión de issues","gestión de solicitudes de extracción","repositorios GitHub"],"fr":["GitHub CLI","outil en ligne de commande","développement de logiciels","gestion des problèmes","gestion des demandes d''extraction","référentiels GitHub"],"de":["GitHub CLI","Kommandozeilen-Tool","Software-Entwicklung","Verwaltung von Issues","Verwaltung von Pull-Requests","GitHub-Repositorys"],"pt":["GitHub CLI","ferramenta de linha de comando","gerenciamento de repositórios","problemas","pull requests","API do GitHub"],"ru":["GitHub CLI","инструмент командной строки","управление репозиториями","проблемы","запросы на включение","API GitHub"],"ar":["جيت هاب سي ال آي","أداة سطر الأوامر","إدارة المستودعات","المشاكل","طلبات الدمج","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيت هاب"]}},"owner":"benchflow-ai","repo":"skillsbench","repoPath":"benchflow-ai/skillsbench","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.570Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gh-cli","description":"The gh CLI is GitHubs official command line tool for interacting with GitHub repositories, issues, pull requests, and more. When needs to interact with GitHub repositories, issues, pull requests, and more, use this skill.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub CLI (gh)\n\nWork seamlessly with GitHub from the command line.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\ngh <command> <subcommand> [flags]\n```\n\n## Core Commands\n\n```\n  issue:      Manage issues\n  pr:         Manage pull requests\n  repo:       Create, clone, fork, and view repositories\n  api:        Make an authenticated GitHub API request\n  run:        View details about workflow runs\n```\n\nUse `gh <command> --help` for more information about a command.\n\n---\n\n## gh pr\n\nWork with GitHub pull requests.\n\n```\nUSAGE\n  gh","body":"# GitHub CLI (gh)\n\nWork seamlessly with GitHub from the command line.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\ngh <command> <subcommand> [flags]\n```\n\n## Core Commands\n\n```\n  issue:      Manage issues\n  pr:         Manage pull requests\n  repo:       Create, clone, fork, and view repositories\n  api:        Make an authenticated GitHub API request\n  run:        View details about workflow runs\n```\n\nUse `gh <command> --help` for more information about a command.\n\n---\n\n## gh pr\n\nWork with GitHub pull requests.\n\n```\nUSAGE\n  gh pr <command> [flags]\n\nCORE COMMANDS\n  checkout:   Check out a pull request in git\n  checks:     Show CI status for a single pull request\n  close:      Close a pull request\n  comment:    Create a new pr comment\n  create:     Create a pull request\n  diff:       View changes in a pull request\n  edit:       Edit a pull request\n  list:       List and filter pull requests in this repository\n  merge:      Merge a pull request\n  ready:      Mark a pull request as ready for review\n  reopen:     Reopen a pull request\n  review:     Add a review to a pull request\n  status:     Show status of relevant pull requests\n  view:       View a pull request\n\nFLAGS\n  -R, --repo [HOST/]OWNER/REPO   Select another repository using the [HOST/]OWNER/REPO format\n\nINHERITED FLAGS\n  --help   Show help for command\n\nARGUMENTS\n  A pull request can be supplied as argument in any of the following formats:\n  - by number, e.g. \"123\";\n  - by URL, e.g. \"https://github.com/OWNER/REPO/pull/123\"; or\n  - by the name of its head branch, e.g. \"patch-1\" or \"OWNER:patch-1\".\n\nEXAMPLES\n  $ gh pr checkout 353\n  $ gh pr create --fill\n  $ gh pr view --web\n\nLEARN MORE\n  Use ''gh <command> <subcommand> --help'' for more information about a command.\n  Read the manual at https://cli.github.com/manual\n```\n\n---\n\n## gh issue\n\nWork with GitHub issues.\n\n```\nUSAGE\n  gh issue <command> [flags]\n\nCORE COMMANDS\n  close:      Close issue\n  comment:    Create a new issue comment\n  create:     Create a new issue\n  delete:     Delete issue\n  edit:       Edit an issue\n  list:       List and filter issues in this repository\n  reopen:     Reopen issue\n  status:     Show status of relevant issues\n  transfer:   Transfer issue to another repository\n  view:       View an issue\n\nFLAGS\n  -R, --repo [HOST/]OWNER/REPO   Select another repository using the [HOST/]OWNER/REPO format\n\nINHERITED FLAGS\n  --help   Show help for command\n\nARGUMENTS\n  An issue can be supplied as argument in any of the following formats:\n  - by number, e.g. \"123\"; or\n  - by URL, e.g. \"https://github.com/OWNER/REPO/issues/123\".\n\nEXAMPLES\n  $ gh issue list\n  $ gh issue create --label bug\n  $ gh issue view --web\n\nLEARN MORE\n  Use ''gh <command> <subcommand> --help'' for more information about a command.\n  Read the manual at https://cli.github.com/manual\n```\n\n---\n\n## gh repo\n\nWork with GitHub repositories.\n\n```\nUSAGE\n  gh repo <command> [flags]\n\nCORE COMMANDS\n  archive:    Archive a repository\n  clone:      Clone a repository locally\n  create:     Create a new repository\n  delete:     Delete a repository\n  edit:       Edit repository settings\n  fork:       Create a fork of a repository\n  list:       List repositories owned by user or organization\n  rename:     Rename a repository\n  sync:       Sync a repository\n  view:       View a repository\n\nINHERITED FLAGS\n  --help   Show help for command\n\nARGUMENTS\n  A repository can be supplied as an argument in any of the following formats:\n  - \"OWNER/REPO\"\n  - by URL, e.g. \"https://github.com/OWNER/REPO\"\n\nEXAMPLES\n  $ gh repo create\n  $ gh repo clone cli/cli\n  $ gh repo view --web\n```\n\n## Search Query Syntax\n\nThe `--search` flag uses GitHub search syntax. Full documentation: https://docs.github.com/en/search-github/getting-started-with-searching-on-github/understanding-the-search-syntax\n\n### Comparison Operators\n\n| Query | Description | Example |\n|-------|-------------|---------|\n| `>n` | Greater than | `stars:>1000` |\n| `>=n` | Greater than or equal | `topics:>=5` |\n| `<n` | Less than | `size:<10000` |\n| `<=n` | Less than or equal | `stars:<=50` |\n\n### Range Queries\n\n| Query | Description | Example |\n|-------|-------------|---------|\n| `n..n` | Between range | `stars:10..50` |\n| `n..*` | Greater than or equal | `stars:10..*` (same as `>=10`) |\n| `*..n` | Less than or equal | `stars:*..10` (same as `<=10`) |\n\n### Date Queries\n\nDate format: `YYYY-MM-DD` (ISO8601). Optional time: `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS+00:00`\n\n| Query | Example |\n|-------|---------|\n| `>YYYY-MM-DD` | `created:>2024-04-29` — after April 29, 2024 |\n| `>=YYYY-MM-DD` | `created:>=2024-04-01` — on or after April 1, 2024 |\n| `<YYYY-MM-DD` | `pushed:<2024-07-05` — before July 5, 2024 |\n| `<=YYYY-MM-DD` | `created:<=2024-07-04` — on or before July 4, 2024 |\n| `YYYY-MM-DD..YYYY-MM-DD` | `created:2024-04-30..2024-07-04` — date range |\n| `YYYY-MM-DD..*` | `created:2024-04-30..*` — on or after date |\n| `*..YYYY-MM-DD` | `created:*..2024-07-04` — on or before date |\n\n### Exclude Results\n\nPrefix qualifier with `-` to exclude:\n\n| Query | Example |\n|-------|---------|\n| `-QUALIFIER` | `stars:>10 -language:javascript` — exclude JavaScript repos |\n| `NOT` | `hello NOT world` — has \"hello\" but not \"world\" |\n\n### Usernames\n\n| Query | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `author:USERNAME` | Filter by specific user |\n| `author:@me` | Filter by current user |\n| `assignee:@me` | Assigned to current user |\n\n### Queries with Whitespace\n\nUse quotation marks for multi-word values:\n- `label:\"bug fix\"` — label with space\n- `cats NOT \"hello world\"` — exclude phrase\n\n---\n\n## JSON Output\n\nCommon fields for `--json`:\n\n**PR**:\n\n```\nadditions\nassignees\nauthor\nbaseRefName\nbody\nchangedFiles\nclosed\nclosedAt\ncomments\ncommits\ncreatedAt\ndeletions\nfiles\nheadRefName\nheadRepository\nheadRepositoryOwner\nid\nisCrossRepository\nisDraft\nlabels\nmaintainerCanModify\nmergeCommit\nmergeStateStatus\nmergeable\nmergedAt\nmergedBy\nmilestone\nnumber\npotentialMergeCommit\nprojectCards\nreactionGroups\nreviewDecision\nreviewRequests\nreviews\nstate\nstatusCheckRollup\ntitle\nupdatedAt\nurl\n```\n\n**Issue**:\n\n```\nclose\n  comment\n  create\n  delete\n  edit\n  list\n  reopen\n  status\n  transfer\n  view\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:15:17.110Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring seamless GitHub integration and command-line workflow automation.","zh":"适用于需要无缝 GitHub 集成和命令行工作流自动化的开发代理。","ja":"GitHub のシームレスな統合とコマンドラインのワークフロー自動化を必要とする開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"無제한 GitHub 통합 및 명령줄 워크플로 자동화가 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una integración perfecta con GitHub y una automatización del flujo de trabajo de línea de comandos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une intégration parfaite avec GitHub et une automatisation du flux de travail en ligne de commande.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine nahtlose GitHub-Integration und eine Automatisierung der Befehlszeilen-Workflow benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem integração perfeita com o GitHub e automação de fluxo de trabalho de linha de comando.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих бесшовной интеграции с GitHub и автоматизации рабочего процесса командной строки.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير العميل التي تتطلب تكاملًا بدون مشاكل مع GitHub وتأتمتة سير عمل سطر الأوامر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage GitHub issues, pull requests, and repositories using authenticated API requests and core commands like ''gh issue'', ''gh pr'', and ''gh repo'', streamlining development workflows with flags and subcommands.","zh":"授权代理使用经过认证的 API 请求和核心命令（如 ''gh issue''、''gh pr'' 和 ''gh repo''）来管理 GitHub 问题、拉取请求和仓库，从而简化开发工作流，并支持标志和子命令。","ja":"認証された API リクエストとコア コマンド（例： ''gh issue''、''gh pr''、''gh repo''）を使用して、エージェントが GitHub の問題、プル リクエスト、リポジトリを管理できるようにし、フラグやサブコマンドで開発ワークフローを最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 인증된 API 요청 및 핵심 명령 (''gh issue'', ''gh pr'', ''gh repo'' 등)을 사용하여 GitHub 문제, 풀 요청 및 리포지토리를 관리할 수 있도록 해줌으로써 개발 워크플ロー 최적화에 플래그 및 하위 명령을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar problemas de GitHub, solicitudes de incorporación y repositorios utilizando solicitudes de API autenticadas y comandos básicos como ''gh issue'', ''gh pr'' y ''gh repo'', optimizando los flujos de trabajo de desarrollo con indicadores y subcomandos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les problèmes GitHub, les demandes d''intégration et les référentiels en utilisant des demandes d''API authentifiées et des commandes de base comme ''gh issue'', ''gh pr'' et ''gh repo'', rationalisant ainsi les flux de travail de développement avec des indicateurs et des sous-commandes.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, GitHub-Probleme, Pull-Requests und Repositorys mithilfe authentifizierter API-Anfragen und Kernbefehlen wie ''gh issue'', ''gh pr'' und ''gh repo'' zu verwalten, wodurch die Entwicklungsworkflows mit Flags und Unterbefehlen optimiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar problemas do GitHub, solicitações de pull e repositórios usando solicitações de API autenticadas e comandos principais como ''gh issue'', ''gh pr'' e ''gh repo'', racionalizando fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento com flags e subcomandos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять проблемами GitHub, запросами на вытягивание и репозиториями с помощью аутентифицированных запросов API и основных команд типа ''gh issue'', ''gh pr'' и ''gh repo'', оптимизируя рабочие процессы разработки с помощью флагов и подкоманд.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة مشاكل GitHub والطلبات السحبية والمستودعات باستخدام طلبات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات المصرح بها والأوامر الأساسية مثل ''gh issue'' و ''gh pr'' و ''gh repo'' ، وتبسيط سير عمل التطوير مع أعلام وأوامر فرعية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pull request management with ''gh pr''","Creating and cloning repositories using ''gh repo''","Debugging workflow runs with ''gh run''"],"zh":["使用 ''gh pr'' 自动化拉取请求管理","使用 ''gh repo'' 创建和克隆仓库","使用 ''gh run'' 调试工作流运行"],"ja":["''gh pr'' を使用してプル リクエストの管理を自動化する","''gh repo'' を使用してリポジトリを作成してクローンする","''gh run'' を使用してワークフロー実行をデバッグする"],"ko":["''gh pr''를 사용하여 풀 요청 관리 자동화","''gh repo''를 사용하여 리포지토리 생성 및 복제","''gh run''을 사용하여 워크플로 실행 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la administración de solicitudes de incorporación con ''gh pr''","Creación y clonación de repositorios con ''gh repo''","Depuración de ejecuciones de flujos de trabajo con ''gh run''"],"fr":["Automatisation de la gestion des demandes d''intégration avec ''gh pr''","Création et clonage de référentiels avec ''gh repo''","Débogage des exécutions de flux de travail avec ''gh run''"],"de":["Automatisierung der Verwaltung von Pull-Requests mit ''gh pr''","Erstellen und Klonen von Repositorys mit ''gh repo''","Fehlerbehebung von Workflow-Ausführungen mit ''gh run''"],"pt":["Automatizar a gestão de solicitações de pull com ''gh pr''","Criar e clonar repositórios usando ''gh repo''","Depurar execuções de fluxo de trabalho com ''gh run''"],"ru":["Автоматизировать управление запросами на вытягивание с помощью ''gh pr''","Создавать и клонировать репозитории с помощью ''gh repo''","Отлаживать выполнение рабочих процессов с помощью ''gh run''"],"ar":["تأتمتة إدارة الطلبات السحبية مع ''gh pr''","إنشاء وتكرار المستودعات باستخدام ''gh repo''","تصحيح أخطاء تشغيل سير عمل التطوير مع ''gh run''"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub authentication","Command-line interface only","Limited to GitHub-specific functionality"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 身份验证","仅限命令行界面","仅限 GitHub 特定功能"],"ja":["GitHub の認証が必要","コマンドライン インターフェイスのみ","GitHub 特有の機能のみ"],"ko":["GitHub 인증 필요","명령줄 인터페이스만 지원","GitHub 특정 기능만 제한"],"es":["Requiere autenticación de GitHub","Solo interfaz de línea de comandos","Limitado a la funcionalidad específica de GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification GitHub","Interface en ligne de commande uniquement","Limité à la fonctionnalité spécifique à GitHub"],"de":["Benötigt GitHub-Authentifizierung","Nur Befehlszeilen-Schnittstelle","Begrenzt auf GitHub-spezifische Funktionalität"],"pt":["Exige autenticação do GitHub","Interface de linha de comando apenas","Limitado à funcionalidade específica do GitHub"],"ru":["Требует аутентификации GitHub","Только интерфейс командной строки","Ограниченная функциональность специфичная для GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب مصادقة GitHub","واجهة سطر الأوامر فقط","محدود بالوظائف المحددة لبرنامج GitHub"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"94c4d99aa20c075de6df4dbc462b59cd6142b49ac73a196dfff9ef3c187c425f","qualityScore":80}');
