"pt":["Gerencie repositórios","Crie e gerencie issues","Trabalhe com pull requests","Faça requisições à API do GitHub","Visualize detalhes de workflow runs"],"ru":["Управляйте репозиториями","Создавайте и управляйте проблемами","Работайте с запросами на включение","Делайте запросы к API GitHub","Просматривайте детали выполнения рабочих процессов"],"ar":["ادارة المستودعات","إنشاء وتحكم القضايا","العمل مع طلبات الدمج","إرسال طلبات إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيت هاب","عرض تفاصيل تشغيل سير العمل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub CLI","命令行工具","开发效率","GitHub API","issue 管理","pull request 管理"],"ja":["GitHub CLI","コマンドラインツール","開発効率","GitHub API","issue 管理","プルリクエスト管理"],"ko":["GitHub CLI","명령줄 도구","개발 효율","GitHub API","이슈 관리","풀リクエスト 관리"],"es":["GitHub CLI","gh-cli","línea de comandos","terminal","gestión de proyectos","issues","pull requests","repositorios"],"fr":["GitHub CLI","gh-cli","ligne de commande","terminal","gestion de projets","problèmes","demandes de tirage","référentiels"],"de":["GitHub CLI","gh-cli","Kommandozeile","Terminal","Projektverwaltung","Issues","Pull-Requests","Repositories"],"pt":["GitHub CLI","ferramenta de linha de comando","desenvolvedores","repositórios","issues","pull requests","API do GitHub"],"ru":["GitHub CLI","инструмент командной строки","разработчики","репозитории","проблемы","запросы на включение","API GitHub"],"ar":["جيت هاب سي ال آي","أداة سطر الأوامر","مطوري البرامج","المستودعات","القضايا","طلبات الدمج","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيت هاب"]}},"owner":"KaiserWhoLearns","repo":"skillsbench","repoPath":"KaiserWhoLearns/skillsbench","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.571Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gh-cli","description":"The gh CLI is GitHubs official command line tool for interacting with GitHub repositories, issues, pull requests, and more. When needs to interact with GitHub repositories, issues, pull requests, and more, use this skill.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub CLI (gh)\n\nWork seamlessly with GitHub from the command line.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\ngh <command> <subcommand> [flags]\n```\n\n## Core Commands\n\n```\n  issue:      Manage issues\n  pr:         Manage pull requests\n  repo:       Create, clone, fork, and view repositories\n  api:        Make an authenticated GitHub API request\n  run:        View details about workflow runs\n```\n\nUse `gh <command> --help` for more information about a command.\n\n---\n\n## gh pr\n\nWork with GitHub pull requests.\n\n```\nUSAGE\n  gh","body":"# GitHub CLI (gh)\n\nWork seamlessly with GitHub from the command line.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\ngh <command> <subcommand> [flags]\n```\n\n## Core Commands\n\n```\n  issue:      Manage issues\n  pr:         Manage pull requests\n  repo:       Create, clone, fork, and view repositories\n  api:        Make an authenticated GitHub API request\n  run:        View details about workflow runs\n```\n\nUse `gh <command> --help` for more information about a command.\n\n---\n\n## gh pr\n\nWork with GitHub pull requests.\n\n```\nUSAGE\n  gh pr <command> [flags]\n\nCORE COMMANDS\n  checkout:   Check out a pull request in git\n  checks:     Show CI status for a single pull request\n  close:      Close a pull request\n  comment:    Create a new pr comment\n  create:     Create a pull request\n  diff:       View changes in a pull request\n  edit:       Edit a pull request\n  list:       List and filter pull requests in this repository\n  merge:      Merge a pull request\n  ready:      Mark a pull request as ready for review\n  reopen:     Reopen a pull request\n  review:     Add a review to a pull request\n  status:     Show status of relevant pull requests\n  view:       View a pull request\n\nFLAGS\n  -R, --repo [HOST/]OWNER/REPO   Select another repository using the [HOST/]OWNER/REPO format\n\nINHERITED FLAGS\n  --help   Show help for command\n\nARGUMENTS\n  A pull request can be supplied as argument in any of the following formats:\n  - by number, e.g. \"123\";\n  - by URL, e.g. \"https://github.com/OWNER/REPO/pull/123\"; or\n  - by the name of its head branch, e.g. \"patch-1\" or \"OWNER:patch-1\".\n\nEXAMPLES\n  $ gh pr checkout 353\n  $ gh pr create --fill\n  $ gh pr view --web\n\nLEARN MORE\n  Use ''gh <command> <subcommand> --help'' for more information about a command.\n  Read the manual at https://cli.github.com/manual\n```\n\n---\n\n## gh issue\n\nWork with GitHub issues.\n\n```\nUSAGE\n  gh issue <command> [flags]\n\nCORE COMMANDS\n  close:      Close issue\n  comment:    Create a new issue comment\n  create:     Create a new issue\n  delete:     Delete issue\n  edit:       Edit an issue\n  list:       List and filter issues in this repository\n  reopen:     Reopen issue\n  status:     Show status of relevant issues\n  transfer:   Transfer issue to another repository\n  view:       View an issue\n\nFLAGS\n  -R, --repo [HOST/]OWNER/REPO   Select another repository using the [HOST/]OWNER/REPO format\n\nINHERITED FLAGS\n  --help   Show help for command\n\nARGUMENTS\n  An issue can be supplied as argument in any of the following formats:\n  - by number, e.g. \"123\"; or\n  - by URL, e.g. \"https://github.com/OWNER/REPO/issues/123\".\n\nEXAMPLES\n  $ gh issue list\n  $ gh issue create --label bug\n  $ gh issue view --web\n\nLEARN MORE\n  Use ''gh <command> <subcommand> --help'' for more information about a command.\n  Read the manual at https://cli.github.com/manual\n```\n\n---\n\n## gh repo\n\nWork with GitHub repositories.\n\n```\nUSAGE\n  gh repo <command> [flags]\n\nCORE COMMANDS\n  archive:    Archive a repository\n  clone:      Clone a repository locally\n  create:     Create a new repository\n  delete:     Delete a repository\n  edit:       Edit repository settings\n  fork:       Create a fork of a repository\n  list:       List repositories owned by user or organization\n  rename:     Rename a repository\n  sync:       Sync a repository\n  view:       View a repository\n\nINHERITED FLAGS\n  --help   Show help for command\n\nARGUMENTS\n  A repository can be supplied as an argument in any of the following formats:\n  - \"OWNER/REPO\"\n  - by URL, e.g. \"https://github.com/OWNER/REPO\"\n\nEXAMPLES\n  $ gh repo create\n  $ gh repo clone cli/cli\n  $ gh repo view --web\n```\n\n## Search Query Syntax\n\nThe `--search` flag uses GitHub search syntax. Full documentation: https://docs.github.com/en/search-github/getting-started-with-searching-on-github/understanding-the-search-syntax\n\n### Comparison Operators\n\n| Query | Description | Example |\n|-------|-------------|---------|\n| `>n` | Greater than | `stars:>1000` |\n| `>=n` | Greater than or equal | `topics:>=5` |\n| `<n` | Less than | `size:<10000` |\n| `<=n` | Less than or equal | `stars:<=50` |\n\n### Range Queries\n\n| Query | Description | Example |\n|-------|-------------|---------|\n| `n..n` | Between range | `stars:10..50` |\n| `n..*` | Greater than or equal | `stars:10..*` (same as `>=10`) |\n| `*..n` | Less than or equal | `stars:*..10` (same as `<=10`) |\n\n### Date Queries\n\nDate format: `YYYY-MM-DD` (ISO8601). Optional time: `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS+00:00`\n\n| Query | Example |\n|-------|---------|\n| `>YYYY-MM-DD` | `created:>2024-04-29` — after April 29, 2024 |\n| `>=YYYY-MM-DD` | `created:>=2024-04-01` — on or after April 1, 2024 |\n| `<YYYY-MM-DD` | `pushed:<2024-07-05` — before July 5, 2024 |\n| `<=YYYY-MM-DD` | `created:<=2024-07-04` — on or before July 4, 2024 |\n| `YYYY-MM-DD..YYYY-MM-DD` | `created:2024-04-30..2024-07-04` — date range |\n| `YYYY-MM-DD..*` | `created:2024-04-30..*` — on or after date |\n| `*..YYYY-MM-DD` | `created:*..2024-07-04` — on or before date |\n\n### Exclude Results\n\nPrefix qualifier with `-` to exclude:\n\n| Query | Example |\n|-------|---------|\n| `-QUALIFIER` | `stars:>10 -language:javascript` — exclude JavaScript repos |\n| `NOT` | `hello NOT world` — has \"hello\" but not \"world\" |\n\n### Usernames\n\n| Query | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `author:USERNAME` | Filter by specific user |\n| `author:@me` | Filter by current user |\n| `assignee:@me` | Assigned to current user |\n\n### Queries with Whitespace\n\nUse quotation marks for multi-word values:\n- `label:\"bug fix\"` — label with space\n- `cats NOT \"hello world\"` — exclude phrase\n\n---\n\n## JSON Output\n\nCommon fields for `--json`:\n\n**PR**:\n\n```\nadditions\nassignees\nauthor\nbaseRefName\nbody\nchangedFiles\nclosed\nclosedAt\ncomments\ncommits\ncreatedAt\ndeletions\nfiles\nheadRefName\nheadRepository\nheadRepositoryOwner\nid\nisCrossRepository\nisDraft\nlabels\nmaintainerCanModify\nmergeCommit\nmergeStateStatus\nmergeable\nmergedAt\nmergedBy\nmilestone\nnumber\npotentialMergeCommit\nprojectCards\nreactionGroups\nreviewDecision\nreviewRequests\nreviews\nstate\nstatusCheckRollup\ntitle\nupdatedAt\nurl\n```\n\n**Issue**:\n\n```\nclose\n  comment\n  create\n  delete\n  edit\n  list\n  reopen\n  status\n  transfer\n  view\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:23:28.870Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps and Version Control Agents requiring seamless GitHub integration from the command line.","zh":"适用于需要从命令行进行无缝 GitHub 集成的 DevOps 和版本控制代理。","ja":"コマンドラインからシームレスな GitHub 統合を必要とする DevOps およびバージョン管理エージェントに適しています。","ko":"명령줄에서 무결점 GitHub 통합을 필요로 하는 DevOps 및 버전 제어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps y Control de Versiones que requieren una integración perfecta con GitHub desde la línea de comandos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps et de contrôle de version nécessitant une intégration transparente de GitHub à partir de la ligne de commande.","de":"Ideal für DevOps- und Version-Control-Agents, die eine nahtlose GitHub-Integration aus der Kommandozeile benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes DevOps e Controle de Versão que requerem integração perfeita com o GitHub na linha de comando.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps и контроля версий, требующих бесшовной интеграции с GitHub из командной строки.","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps ومراقبة الإصدار الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج مثالي مع GitHub من سطر الأوامر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage issues, pull requests, and repositories using GitHub CLI commands like ''gh issue'', ''gh pr'', and ''gh repo'', while also making authenticated GitHub API requests with ''gh api''.","zh":"赋予代理管理问题、拉取请求和存储库的能力，使用 GitHub CLI 命令，如 ''gh issue''、''gh pr'' 和 ''gh repo''，同时也可以使用 ''gh api'' 进行认证的 GitHub API 请求。","ja":"エージェントが ''gh issue''、''gh pr''、''gh repo'' などの GitHub CLI コマンドを使用して問題、プルリクエスト、リポジトリを管理し、''gh api'' を使用して認証された GitHub API リクエストを行うことができるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 ''gh issue'', ''gh pr'', ''gh repo'' 등 GitHub CLI 명령을 사용하여 문제, 풀 요청 및 저장소를 관리할 수 있도록 하고, ''gh api''를 사용하여 인증된 GitHub API 요청을 수행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar problemas, solicitudes de extracción y repositorios utilizando comandos de GitHub CLI como ''gh issue'', ''gh pr'' y ''gh repo'', y también a realizar solicitudes de API de GitHub autenticadas con ''gh api''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les problèmes, les demandes d''extraction et les référentiels en utilisant des commandes GitHub CLI comme ''gh issue'', ''gh pr'' et ''gh repo'', et effectue également des requêtes d''API GitHub authentifiées avec ''gh api''.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Probleme, Pull-Anfragen und Repositorys mithilfe von GitHub-CLI-Befehlen wie ''gh issue'', ''gh pr'' und ''gh repo'' zu verwalten und authentifizierte GitHub-API-Anfragen mit ''gh api'' durchzuführen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar problemas, solicitações de pull e repositórios usando comandos CLI do GitHub como ''gh issue'', ''gh pr'' e ''gh repo'', além de fazer solicitações de API do GitHub autenticadas com ''gh api''.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять проблемами, запросами на вытягивание и репозиториями, используя команды GitHub CLI, такие как ''gh issue'', ''gh pr'' и ''gh repo'', а также выполнять аутентифицированные запросы к API GitHub с помощью ''gh api''.","ar":"يمنح العميل إدارة المشاكل وطلبات السحب والمستودعات باستخدام أوامر GitHub CLI مثل ''gh issue'' و ''gh pr'' و ''gh repo'' ، بالإضافة إلى إجراء طلبات API GitHub المثبتة مع ''gh api''."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue management with ''gh issue'' commands","Streamlining pull request workflows using ''gh pr'' subcommands","Creating and cloning repositories with ''gh repo'' commands"],"zh":["使用 ''gh issue'' 命令自动化问题管理","使用 ''gh pr'' 子命令简化拉取请求工作流","使用 ''gh repo'' 命令创建和克隆存储库"],"ja":["''gh issue'' コマンドを使用して問題管理を自動化する","''gh pr'' サブコマンドを使用してプルリクエストのワークフローを合理化する","''gh repo'' コマンドを使用してリポジトリを作成および複製する"],"ko":["''gh issue'' 명령을 사용하여 문제 관리를 자동화하는 것","''gh pr'' 하위 명령을 사용하여 풀 요청 워크플ロー 스트림을 지정하는 것","''gh repo'' 명령을 사용하여 저장소를 생성하고 복제하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la gestión de problemas con comandos ''gh issue''","Optimizar los flujos de trabajo de solicitudes de extracción utilizando subcomandos ''gh pr''","Crear y clonar repositorios con comandos ''gh repo''"],"fr":["Automatiser la gestion des problèmes avec des commandes ''gh issue''","Optimiser les flux de travail des demandes d''extraction en utilisant des sous-commandes ''gh pr''","Créer et cloner des référentiels avec des commandes ''gh repo''"],"de":["Automatisieren der Problemmangement mit ''gh issue''-Befehlen","Optimieren der Pull-Anfrage-Workflows mit ''gh pr''-Unterbefehlen","Erstellen und Klonen von Repositorys mit ''gh repo''-Befehlen"],"pt":["Automatizar a gestão de problemas com comandos ''gh issue''","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de solicitações de pull usando subcomandos ''gh pr''","Criar e clonar repositórios com comandos ''gh repo''"],"ru":["Автоматизировать управление проблемами с помощью команд ''gh issue''","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы запросов на вытягивание, используя подкоманды ''gh pr''","Создавать и клонировать репозитории с помощью команд ''gh repo''"],"ar":["أتمتة إدارة المشاكل بأوامر ''gh issue''","تسهيل سير عمل طلبات السحب باستخدام أوامر فرعية ''gh pr''","إنشاء ومحاكاة المستودعات بأوامر ''gh repo''"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI installation and configuration","Needs authentication for GitHub API requests"],"zh":["需要 GitHub CLI 的安装和配置","需要认证以进行 GitHub API 请求"],"ja":["GitHub CLI のインストールと構成が必要","GitHub API リクエストを実行するには認証が必要"],"ko":["GitHub CLI 설치 및 구성이 필요합니다","GitHub API 요청을 수행하려면 인증이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de GitHub CLI","Necesita autenticación para las solicitudes de API de GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de GitHub CLI","Nécessite une authentification pour les requêtes d''API GitHub"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration von GitHub CLI","Benötigt eine Authentifizierung für GitHub-API-Anfragen"],"pt":["Exige a instalação e configuração do GitHub CLI","Necessita de autenticação para solicitações de API do GitHub"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки GitHub CLI","Требует аутентификации для запросов к API GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين واجهة سطر أوامر GitHub","يحتاج إلى مصادقة لطلبات API GitHub"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"94c4d99aa20c075de6df4dbc462b59cd6142b49ac73a196dfff9ef3c187c425f","qualityScore":80}');
